{"name": "Magic Fruit World", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4217360/extras_big/55dac32544754c6e9191b41e5bbd3f2a.webp?t=1793545694\" height=\"535\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4217360/extras/55dac32544754c6e9191b41e5bbd3f2a.avif?t=1793545694\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4217360/extras/fe54f2fe43e37e68da166cb5990a9c83.poster.avif?t=1793545694\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4217360/extras/fe54f2fe43e37e68da166cb5990a9c83.webm?t=1793545694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4217360/extras/fe54f2fe43e37e68da166cb5990a9c83.mp4?t=1793545694\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Magic Fruit World is a platforming adventure where exploration, combat, and absolute mastery converge in a universe full of secrets. Face increasingly dangerous enemies, uncover hidden rewards, and push your skills to the limit in every level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4217360/extras/ed236f1801fa0e01ce1320a290ccd4c9.poster.avif?t=1793545694\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4217360/extras/ed236f1801fa0e01ce1320a290ccd4c9.webm?t=1793545694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4217360/extras/ed236f1801fa0e01ce1320a290ccd4c9.mp4?t=1793545694\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4217360/extras_big/ea21b7cef6011eddeb48885813328035.webp?t=1793545694\" height=\"569\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4217360/extras/ea21b7cef6011eddeb48885813328035.avif?t=1793545694\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combat plays a central role in your journey. Enemies are aggressive and challenging, requiring precise skill, timing, and strategy to overcome. Harness the power of Magic Fruits, unique abilities that can turn the tide of battle. Carry up to 4 fruits at once, combining offensive powers, utility skills, and second chances when you need them the most. Every encounter matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4217360/extras/3e93365f60d1a552145f79fe1b274f7f.poster.avif?t=1793545694\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4217360/extras/3e93365f60d1a552145f79fe1b274f7f.webm?t=1793545694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4217360/extras/3e93365f60d1a552145f79fe1b274f7f.mp4?t=1793545694\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4217360/extras_big/6ff5dc87f4ffc9b3ec3cabb9f9a62122.webp?t=1793545694\" height=\"588\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4217360/extras/6ff5dc87f4ffc9b3ec3cabb9f9a62122.avif?t=1793545694\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Open Magic Fruits and see what you get. Ultra Fruits, artifacts and characters come in rarities up to Epic, while skins and pets go all the way to Immortal, the hardest thing to obtain in the whole game. You can also unlock backgrounds, sounds, music, flags, collectibles and much more. Every Magic Fruit you open is another chance at something extraordinary. Magic Fruits grant random rewards; the drop rate of every rarity is published in-game before you open one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4217360/extras_big/1f713ae1d1187ec19eab51363232c600.webp?t=1793545694\" height=\"569\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4217360/extras/1f713ae1d1187ec19eab51363232c600.avif?t=1793545694\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Go beyond traditional platformers with massive, ambitious environments. Each world features dozens of levels, offering extended gameplay and encouraging deeper exploration. Take your time, explore every path, and uncover what lies beyond the obvious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4217360/extras/18647e2c2646d0147c1f607f33c18a7a.poster.avif?t=1793545694\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4217360/extras/18647e2c2646d0147c1f607f33c18a7a.webm?t=1793545694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4217360/extras/18647e2c2646d0147c1f607f33c18a7a.mp4?t=1793545694\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4217360/extras_big/3d7e68dcf9b3dc56fd867b26512bd1e3.webp?t=1793545694\" height=\"406\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4217360/extras/3d7e68dcf9b3dc56fd867b26512bd1e3.avif?t=1793545694\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every level is meticulously designed to be replayed. Discover secrets, optimize your runs, and complete unique challenges:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Finish levels as fast as possible</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect every coin</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find all hidden fruits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete levels without taking damage</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mastery is rewarded. Completion is earned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"518\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4217360/extras/85548d049ae82a4c6c4122791c4d6fcc.poster.avif?t=1793545694\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4217360/extras/85548d049ae82a4c6c4122791c4d6fcc.webm?t=1793545694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4217360/extras/85548d049ae82a4c6c4122791c4d6fcc.mp4?t=1793545694\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4217360/extras_big/b1c940bf6b398326d135eb89d3356aaa.webp?t=1793545694\" height=\"406\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4217360/extras/b1c940bf6b398326d135eb89d3356aaa.avif?t=1793545694\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you are chasing 100% completion or refining your mechanical skills, Magic Fruit World constantly rewards dedication and progression. There is always something new to discover, and there is always a better run to achieve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"518\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4217360/extras/4e14c79cf601939ef3e2f4b250b4d2d4.poster.avif?t=1793545694\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4217360/extras/4e14c79cf601939ef3e2f4b250b4d2d4.webm?t=1793545694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4217360/extras/4e14c79cf601939ef3e2f4b250b4d2d4.mp4?t=1793545694\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4217360/extras_big/2613904d0298d35f964db5f3cb0d1692.webp?t=1793545694\" height=\"588\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4217360/extras/2613904d0298d35f964db5f3cb0d1692.avif?t=1793545694\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every treasure you uncover out in the worlds needs somewhere to go. The Mansion is your own space to show off what you have earned, placing each piece exactly where you want it. Treasures, artifacts and suits climb through the rarities all the way to Immortal, and completing the collection takes real dedication.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"566\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4217360/extras/0e30f6f3d3d477a82ef7f504f6cbbe92.poster.avif?t=1793545694\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4217360/extras/0e30f6f3d3d477a82ef7f504f6cbbe92.webm?t=1793545694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4217360/extras/0e30f6f3d3d477a82ef7f504f6cbbe92.mp4?t=1793545694\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4217360/extras_big/f81896f7b3d6b04a4883dc4450d94d44.webp?t=1793545694\" height=\"574\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4217360/extras/f81896f7b3d6b04a4883dc4450d94d44.avif?t=1793545694\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect endearing pets that will faithfully follow you everywhere. More than just simple companions, these little friends fully integrate into your gameplay, making your journey through the world a much more vibrant and special experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"518\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4217360/extras/19614c8de59b1640e2890e33efe98c3a.poster.avif?t=1793545694\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4217360/extras/19614c8de59b1640e2890e33efe98c3a.webm?t=1793545694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4217360/extras/19614c8de59b1640e2890e33efe98c3a.mp4?t=1793545694\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Magic Fruit World is an intense platforming adventure combining deep exploration and tactical combat. Master the power of Magic Fruits to face relentless enemies, uncover secrets in expansive worlds, and perfect your skills in levels built for high replayability.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4217360/129f9954737fb2ef45da7421e26c9063cc5aaa09/header.jpg?t=1793545694", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action", "Adventure", "Casual", "Action-Adventure", "Side Scroller", "2.5D"], "developers": "Zelcar Games", "publishers": "Zelcar Games", "release_date": "Nov 1, 2026", "price": "Free To Play", "appid": "4217360", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "1 November 2026 - Free To Play", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/EEv9S2U2Jwk", "first_seen": 1793487600.0, "review_rank": 6}